[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401974285","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111640#issuecomment-3401974285","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111640","id":3401974285,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KxgIN","user":{"login":"KaenguruuDev","id":63197149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTk3MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63197149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev","html_url":"https://github.com/KaenguruuDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T13:44:49Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T13:44:49Z","body":"Shouldn't this be the intended behavior? Assuming `value` to be something like a `float` or a `double` or an `int` these statements don't have any effect since the parameter `value` is passed by value and not by reference. Meaning if you have a method like this that only increments this parameter and doesn't do anything else with it (like returning it or using it to access an array or whatever), it will have no effect outside the scope of the function and you could argue that that's the same as just not using the parameter.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401974285/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401978317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111640#issuecomment-3401978317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111640","id":3401978317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KxhHN","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T13:45:46Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T13:45:46Z","body":"The value is indeed not used, I'd say that `value = value + 1` is *incorrect* in not throwing the warning, not the other way around","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401978317/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402741867","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111640#issuecomment-3402741867","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111640","id":3402741867,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7K0bhr","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T16:35:50Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T16:35:50Z","body":"FYI, consider compiling the following C code with ` -Wunused-parameter`:\n\n```c\nvoid foo(int value) {\n    value += 1;\n}\n\nvoid bar(int value) {\n    value = value + 1;\n}\n\nvoid foobar(int value) {\n}\n```\n\nBoth `+` and `+=` are considered used.\n\n```\ntest.c:9:17: warning: unused parameter 'value' [-Wunused-parameter]\n    9 | void foobar(int value) {\n      |                 ^\n1 warning generated.\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402741867/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402762709","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111640#issuecomment-3402762709","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111640","id":3402762709,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7K0gnV","user":{"login":"KaenguruuDev","id":63197149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTk3MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63197149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev","html_url":"https://github.com/KaenguruuDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KaenguruuDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T16:41:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T16:44:27Z","body":"Thats quite interesting to see.\n\nI tried C# and had some different results. In the first scenario with `+=` it doesn't view it as unused but as assignment of a variable that is never used again. That could be a good compromise for this.\n\n`value = value + 1;` gets highlighted by my linter with a suggestion to format it to `value += 1` but doesn't produce any actual warnings.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402762709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3403225833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111640#issuecomment-3403225833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111640","id":3403225833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7K2Rrp","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T19:09:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T19:09:24Z","body":"I'd say considering it used is incorrect for that, as it doesn't actually *use* it in any real way, there's no difference between that and just assigning to it when declaring it etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3403225833/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3488268100","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111640#issuecomment-3488268100","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111640","id":3488268100,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7P6r9E","user":{"login":"OffsetMOSFET","id":91294328,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxMjk0MzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/91294328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET","html_url":"https://github.com/OffsetMOSFET","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OffsetMOSFET/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-04T22:44:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T22:44:23Z","body":"> FYI, consider compiling the following C code with ` -Wunused-parameter`:\n> \n> void foo(int value) {\n>     value += 1;\n> }\n> \n> void bar(int value) {\n>     value = value + 1;\n> }\n> \n> void foobar(int value) {\n> }\n> Both `+` and `+=` are considered used.\n> \n> ```\n> test.c:9:17: warning: unused parameter 'value' [-Wunused-parameter]\n>     9 | void foobar(int value) {\n>       |                 ^\n> 1 warning generated.\n> ```\n\nIMO, in C, the local variable can point to nonlocal data, so writing to it can cause side effects.\n\nIn these examples are there no side effects. I'm guessing the compiler is doing a simple check during compilation for the warning?\n\nGDScript shouldn't have any side effects with addition.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3488268100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3497528994","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111640#issuecomment-3497528994","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111640","id":3497528994,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QeA6i","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-06T14:31:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-06T14:31:25Z","body":"> I'm guessing the compiler is doing a simple check during compilation for the warning?\n> \n> GDScript shouldn't have any side effects with addition.\n\nGDScript currently makes almost no assumptions about side effect guarantees, even in \"simple\" cases. The probability of error with the current level of static analysis is too high.\n\nThis issue demonstrates a curious example where we occasionally get the correct \"smart\" warning for a combined assignment, but not for the equivalent simple assignment. I'm not sure we should remove the correct behavior, but I also don't think we should try to implement correct behavior in the second case (at least with the current level of static analysis in GDScript).\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3497528994/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3497558927","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111640#issuecomment-3497558927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111640","id":3497558927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QeIOP","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-06T14:38:06Z","updated_at":"2025-11-06T14:38:06Z","body":"I think it'd be good to fully define what \"used\" means and clarify that in documentation to make sure what it should and shouldn't check for","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3497558927/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]